# Admin Panel

- Routes under `/admin` use `AdminShell` (not the public header/footer).
- CRUD via server actions in `app/admin/actions.ts` + `revalidatePath`.
- Data access for admin: `lib/db/admin.ts` (includes unpublished).
- UI copy in Spanish; forms use `components/admin/AdminUi.tsx`.
- Image fields store public paths/URLs (e.g. `/images/plans/...`) until upload exists.
- After create/update, keep public `/portafolio` in sync via revalidation.
